# Session diagnostics — the worked example (11 Oct 2026). Proven by three rounds and the live try-out.
# The body (PpSessionDiagnosticsBody.qml) carries objectName "sdBody" and exposes its data, its tab
# (`tab`, writable: shot | session | watching), its view (`view`: the tab, or "detail" while a
# condition is open) and the detail hooks _openDetail(id) / _closeDetail() / detailOpen.
TARGET=sdBody
PANEL_KEY=sessionDiagnostics
FEED=readout,cards,source,header,detail
TAB_PROP=tab
VIEW_PROP=view
VIEWS=shot,session,watching,detail
DETAIL=over_the_top
